Finance Soul re-implements in its own words and code methods described in the
following open-source projects. No source text or code was copied verbatim
unless stated below.

- anthropics/financial-services — Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/anthropics/financial-services
  Used: structure and integrity checks of three-statement models
  (3-statement-model), spreadsheet audit checklist (audit-xls). Inspired
  skills/three-statement-guide and agents/model-auditor.

- JeffBrines/openfpa — MIT License, Copyright (c) Jeff Brines
  https://github.com/JeffBrines/openfpa
  Used: CFO judgment reflexes (fpa-cfo-judgment), cash runway method
  (fpa-cash-runway), the idea of a tested finance kernel driven by an agent.
  Inspired agents/cfo-reviewer and skills/cash-runway-guide.

- Jakeschincariol/founder-skill — MIT License
  https://github.com/Jakeschincariol/founder-skill
  Used: the founder-cfo pattern (numbers file -> script -> report, every
  number traceable to an input, what-ifs instead of guesses, ramp scepticism).
  Inspired skills/unit-economics-guide and skills/assumptions.

- aibatjardem/agentsoul — MIT License
  https://github.com/aibatjardem/agentsoul
  Used: three-layer architecture (soul / skills / subagents), the
  SessionStart hook (adapted: hooks/session-start), hooks/run-hook.cmd.

- obra/superpowers — MIT License, Copyright (c) Jesse Vincent
  hooks/run-hook.cmd is adapted from obra/superpowers via agentsoul.

Projects reviewed for ideas only, with nothing copied (non-commercial or AGPL
licences): huaxialucaicaizi/ai-startup-skills, huaxialucaicaizi/business-plan-skill,
hoaxnerd/burnless, danku13/CanvasDesk.
